# Secret Identity, Conceal: "Until end of turn, target creature you control becomes a Citizen with base power and toughness
# 1/1 and gains hexproof." Bot1's Ornithopter (0/2 Thopter) becomes a 1/1 Citizen (the creature type replaced, it stays an
# artifact creature) with hexproof. Its mode asks only for creatures Bot1 controls (Bot2's Ornithopter is refused). Bot2's
# Lightning Bolt in the same turn then cannot target the hexproof Ornithopter (CR 702.11b), with the Fanatic of Rhonas as the positive control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Fanatic of Rhonas
Secret Identity
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

